@host = http://localhost:5263

GET {{host}}/api/customers
Accept: application/json

### Create customer
POST {{host}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerName":"Example Customer","email":"buyer@example.com"}

### Replace IDs below with IDs returned by creation requests
POST {{host}}/api/rfqs
Content-Type: application/json

{"rfqNumber":"RFQ-001","customerId":1,"status":"Draft"}

### Create item
POST {{host}}/api/rfqs/1/items
Content-Type: application/json

{"materialNo":"MAT-001","description":"Sample item","quantity":2.5,"unit":"Nos"}

### List items
GET {{host}}/api/rfqs/1/items

### Look up Mastersheet data for an RFQ item
GET {{host}}/api/rfqs/1/items/1/master

### Search materials
GET {{host}}/api/materials?search=MAT&isActive=true

### Get a material and its ordered routing
GET {{host}}/api/materials/MAT-001

### List metal/density master
GET {{host}}/api/metals?isActive=true

### List process master
GET {{host}}/api/processes?isActive=true

### List vendors
GET {{host}}/api/vendors?isActive=true

### List vendor rates
GET {{host}}/api/vendor-process-rates
